{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_hbisc2_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_hbisc2_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"無名之花","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_hbisc2_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"f7c89187088147b2b96e11f9fa11034928e3eb5e94f54b6e3b5ac2aca2f88976","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"即使被所有人恐懼、排斥，芙蓉也從來沒有放棄過醫生的責任。而在災難來臨時，被人厭棄的薩卡茲卻成為了夕照區最後的希望。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g8_concerthall_outside_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉！你在哪——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的小男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的腿......好痛，好痛啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別害怕，不要亂動，讓我檢查一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好，只是淤青而已。沒有擦破皮，也沒有傷及骨頭。我幫你上些藥水，應該沒什麼事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的小男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是......真的好痛。只要一動，就痛得受不了了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我也體驗過的。我小時候有一次也摔傷了腿，流了好多好多血，當時我又疼又怕，嚇得哭出來啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你現在沒有哭，說明你是個堅強的孩子，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的小男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（努力地揉揉眼睛）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是呢，你要是一直坐在這裡的話，傷可不會自己好起來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要一直坐在這冰冷的雨水裡，還是回到家裡，在自己軟和的小床上慢慢養傷呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的小男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，扶著我的手，慢慢站起來。嗯，真棒。可以自己走回家嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的小男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是個勇敢的孩子，快回家吧。爸爸媽媽都在家裡等著你呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的小男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"謝、謝謝姐姐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉，音樂會到底發生了什麼事情，怎麼只有你一個人在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行板......你來得正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來不及解釋了。這裡有一些傷患，我剛幫他們做了簡單的傷口處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是周圍，源石濃度很高......你，快帶他們回辦事處，再、再仔細檢查一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開什麼玩笑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在哪輪得到你照顧別人？你身上這傷是怎麼回事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傷？你在說什麼呀......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g8_concerthall_outside_n"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，你何必——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——黑鍵，這裡由我擋住，趁現在！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g8_concerthall_outside_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會，那時我明明是擋下來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心，別看我這樣，其實我也是跟小炎熔學過幾招的，也是會源石技——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g2_slumstreets"},{"type":"narration","text":"幾日前"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，我接到了醫療求助電話，請問這裡是達隆先生家嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病弱的男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼是你......行板呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行板醫生出診了，我代替她來查看一下情況。請您放心，我和她一樣是接受過專業的醫師培訓的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"方便的話，可以讓我進去給您做檢查嗎？只是一些很基礎的檢測，不會抽血——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病弱的男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要靠近我的屋子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請不要緊張，沒有您的允許，我當然不會靠近的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，您聽上去身體狀況很不理想，最好還是及時接受檢查——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病弱的男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"和你有什麼關係！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病弱的男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這段時間我的身體一直很好，可就是你這個薩卡茲來到夕照區後我才生病的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病弱的男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"預言說的一點錯都沒有，就是你們薩卡茲給夕照區帶來了災厄！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情很複雜，我不知道該怎麼向您解釋......但是您現在急需幫助，身體健康才是最重要的不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病弱的男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"夠了！我就算病死，也不會祈求薩卡茲的幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，您不願意接受檢查的話，我絕不會強迫您做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這有一些您可能會需要的藥——這不是薩卡茲的幫助，我只是替羅德島把藥送給需要的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把藥放在門口，過一會您自己來拿，好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病弱的男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快點離開這......否則我就要叫治安官了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起......我這就離開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g2_slumstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到現在，整個夕照區基本查過一遍了。按異常好轉的感染者的數量，辦事處的物資儲備是不足以面對特殊情況的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼訂購的藥物還沒有送到呢......剛才那位先生，希望他不要浪費藥啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"彷彿聽到了一聲遙遠的呼喚，芙蓉突然回過頭，卻發現身後空無一人。\n家家門戶緊閉，幾日前載歌載舞的景象就像是錯誤的記憶。\n但老舊的牆垣，地上殘破的青灰石板，仔細看去，竟然是那麼眼熟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃商販","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉啊，我就讓你幫我把明天份的食材搬到倉庫，你怎麼把一周的都搬來啦。這孩子，也真不嫌累。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"不客氣大叔！可別小看薩卡茲的力氣呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃商販","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好好好......累壞了吧，喏，這有剛出鍋的馬鈴薯炸鱗，拿兩份回去和妹妹分著吃吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝大叔。但是媽媽應該已經做好晚飯啦，我和炎熔分一份就好啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水果商販","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就說吧，別讓人家姑娘吃太多油炸食品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水果商販","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉啊，這一袋水果帶回去吧。特地給你留的，包甜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水果商販","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"客氣什麼，下次還要拜託你幫我家那小子輔導作業哪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g2_slumstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別胡思亂想了，打起精神來啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g4_embassy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我回來啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼又跑出去了！不是說好這幾天的調查都交給我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在夕照區的病情這麼複雜，不能全部交給你一個人呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是去給有需要的病人送一點藥，不會引人注目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒有人再為難你吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生說過，醫療幹員在外執行任務時，要首先確保自身的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像之前那天的情況，雖然確實是他們的錯，但你那樣衝在前面，實在是太危險了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，後來，我也有反思的......當時只是有些生氣，又著急，就想一定要爭個對錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但事後想想，那樣的爭論，實在是沒有意義的呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道反省就好。總之，下次再做這樣冒險的事，我可就要給本艦打報告了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，我想大家原本也是沒有惡意的，只是最近發生了許多事，大家心裡都很害怕吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記得我到夕照區的第一天，還有人熱情地邀請我跳舞呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個人，估計是把你認成卡普里尼了吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我認為不是哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我也是最近才發現，對於卡普里尼來說，薩卡茲和卡普里尼的角，是一眼就可以看出分別的。之前我還總以為區別沒有那麼大呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，給你講一個笑話吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，就在到達維謝海姆前，我在路上遇到了一個昏迷的卡普里尼女孩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我給她餵了一些藥和水，她醒來的時候，好像認出了我是薩卡茲，看上去很害怕的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時我也很慌亂，不想讓她受驚嚇，就說：“別害怕，其實我也是卡普里尼！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果她完全沒有相信，馬上就尖叫著跑開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在回過頭想想，實在是太好笑了，怎麼會有薩卡茲這麼介紹自己呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一點都不好笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去開門。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蠻橫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼是你......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g2_slumstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蠻橫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛剛從我家出來，不記得了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蠻橫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是他兒子！你敢抽我父親的血！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g4_embassy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蠻橫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行板醫生呢？我有事找她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（用手比劃“就說我不在”）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請問，有什麼事嗎？行板醫生不在，我可以代為效勞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蠻橫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，我，這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蠻橫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請，請救救我的父親！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老施耐德先生？他怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蠻橫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前幾天，父親的身體狀況都還不錯。但從今天早上開始，他看起來就不太對勁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蠻橫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高燒不退，皮膚上甚至出現了新的結晶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蠻橫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生！求求你救——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帶我過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蠻橫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，你答應了......？謝——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說那麼多了，我們現在就出發。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病弱的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（痛苦的呻吟）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生，我父親他——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛對他做了最基本的穩定病情的處理，現在暫時脫離危險了。讓他好好睡一覺吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的病情，還能好轉嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得實話實說，你父親的病情，算不上樂觀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會這樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和夕照區其他很多人一樣，你父親這兩天身體異常好轉的現象，本質是一種“假癒”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身體會調動沒受損的部分，去補償在損傷中失去的功能。但這種調節機制終究不是一種穩定態，總是有一個極限的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的父親現在正處於假癒之後的“失代償”階段，礦石病病症會急劇加重。加上老人年歲已高，這種失衡只會表現得更嚴重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得，您之前好像就說過相關的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是我的錯，要是我能早點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為過去的錯誤後悔也沒有用，重要的是接下來這段時間，你要格外注意照顧你父親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要嚴格控制飲食起居，小心維持病人各方面機能的平衡。這種時候，對病人的護理比治療更為重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，我一定照做！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉醫生......那個，之前的事，對——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":true,"text":"芙蓉，你在嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":true,"text":"情況有些不對勁，我們需要——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍等一下，不要打擾到病人，我出去再和你說。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g2_slumstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行板，你說怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":true,"text":"就在你剛走沒多久，辦事處就接連接收了十幾個病人。有的是突然昏厥，有的是生命體徵突然急劇衰弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":true,"text":"同時還有很多人因為各種病情來求助，但短時間內還無法確認到底是否為礦石病併發症。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然，老施耐德先生的病情並非個例，到了這個時間點，恐怕很多異常好轉的病人都要進入失代償階段了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"僅靠羅德島辦事處的收容能力肯定是不夠的，行板，聯繫過其他醫院了嗎，他們能否收治一些病人，之前預訂的藥物能不能及時送到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":true,"text":"已經聯繫過了，但是都推三阻四。而且他們還說......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":true,"text":"高庭區有更高的價值，他們要首先確保高庭區有充足的醫療資源儲備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可以說這種不負責的話！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行板，你先堅持一下，我馬上回來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":true,"text":"芙蓉，先冷靜一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":true,"text":"現在正是人心惶惶的時候。還有不少人相信謠言。這種情況，你還是不要貿然現身比較好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我不能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你說得對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行板，辦事處的病人，可以先拜託你來照顧嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":true,"text":"放心吧，在夕照區待了這麼久，我也是有些經驗的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也來幫忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是你的父親......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暫時可以委託隔壁鄰居照顧——你們現在很缺人手吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我也做點事吧，什麼都行，拜託了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，這份名單上，有我之前統計到的發生異常好轉的病人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你對夕照區比較熟悉，那就麻煩你對照名單，把病情急劇加重的病人帶到辦事處集中治療。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醫院那邊，就交給我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去當面說服他們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g4_embassy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐慌的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"醫生，救，救我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哭泣的小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚——我想回家......"},{"type":"narration","text":"狹小侷促的空間裡，容納著數倍於平時的病人。\n哭聲，呻吟聲，還有疾病的味道在空氣中混雜著，織成令人窒息的網。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......這是什麼味道——行板醫生，我把病人都帶回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"病人的數量......不，再怎麼說，這人也太多了。和之前統計的異常好轉者數量完全對不上啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說應急藥物，在這個環境裡病菌交叉感染都夠要命了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":true,"text":"行板，你說的對。在這個情況下，恐慌可能是比疾病本身更大的威脅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":true,"text":"病人也無法判斷自身情況，不管到底是不是進入失代償階段的礦石病人，都會將身體不適歸結於未知的恐懼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":true,"text":"當務之急是確認病人身體異常的具體原因，分別處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":true,"text":"進入失代償階段的病人，身體會陷入急劇的機能失衡，在無法及時檢測血液的情況下，體溫異常是最直接的表——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉！你那邊還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"行板，辦事處那邊，還是先拜託你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你放心，我一定會把藥帶回來的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好的！你也要小心一點！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g1_gorgeousstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"治安官隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"醫生，就是這個人鬧事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私人醫院醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這位女士，這裡是私人醫院病房，哪怕您是其他醫療機構的成員，沒有獲得審批也是不允許入內的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私人醫院醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我最後再勸告一遍，請馬上離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同樣作為醫護人員，我本不願意打擾同行的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可任由一個只是感冒的病人占著可以收容十個人的空間，這就是你們說的“物資不足，床位不足”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私人醫院醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"根據病人身份的特殊性，我們也有自己的判斷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"醫生，怎麼回事？她，她是不是那個預言中的惡魔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"來，來人！救命！把這個薩卡茲從我的房間裡拖出去啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，如果我真的是預言裡的惡魔，您認為這裡有人可以救您嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噫——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"治安官隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要輕舉妄動！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一時間，十幾支法杖一齊對準了芙蓉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私人醫院醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請不要威脅病人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會威脅病人，我只是作為醫護人員勸誡你們，回憶一下醫者應有的道德，承擔起醫者應有的責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在夕照區有許多人正身處極端的危險中，我只是要求你們按照協議向羅德島辦事處提供必要的藥物，收治一定數量的病人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這難道是一個過分的要求嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私人醫院醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過是個可疑的外來者。那個預言已經人盡皆知，這種時候我為什麼要聽從你的話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私人醫院醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不想再和她糾纏了，治安官閣下，請讓她出去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就請將我當作惡魔吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是相信預言嗎，預言是怎麼說的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“血中的惡疾隱伏，款款招來蔓延的死亡。”你想不想看看，夕照區已經如預言發展到了哪一步？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"預言中的惡魔就站在你面前。現在抓捕我也好，驅逐我也好，你盡可以做你認為可以自保的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後看看更高貴的高庭區，能否在災難中獨善其身？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g3_slumstreets_night"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡爾先生，體溫正常，血液源石密度小幅上升。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪爾塔太太，體溫正常，血液源石密度正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好多病例......好多器材......我......搬不動了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不要吃健康餐......我想吃肉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來行板今天是沒顧上吃飯，夢裡都在吃東西呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——行板，口水都要流出來啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉醫生......您怎麼還沒休息啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是統計一下病人的情況。白天的時候不方便露面，在晚上也該做點什麼啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天你也很辛苦了，謝謝你來幫忙。沒什麼事的話，就先回家休息吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是，留在這吧......對了，給您水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"narration","text":"芙蓉伸出手想要接過水瓶，手卻脫力似的沒能抓住。水瓶掉在地上，滾了出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉......我來撿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您沒事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事沒事，只是不小心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天下午的時候，您離開沒多久，就有醫院派車過來了，您到底是怎麼說服他們的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼說服......似乎也不能說是“曉之以理動之以情”呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，情況最終安定下來就好。這片暫時的隔離區明天應該就可以收起來啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉醫生......我，我有個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛來夕照區，和我們非親非故。何況，還有人，做了那麼過分的事......為什麼，你還願意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，仔細想想，這還是第一次被人當作醫生看待呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在本部的時候，主要做的還是一些照顧病人還有輔助醫生的工作。現在是我第一次自己承擔起主治醫生的工作呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看，你都叫我醫生啦。我當然應該履行自己的職責啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前，對您說的那些話，您也願意原諒嗎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要是說，其實沒有原諒呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的很對不起！我、我該死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您要是覺得氣不過，用笛子再揍我一頓也行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦好啦，我開玩笑的。你別打自己啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，要是說一點都不在意的話，大概也是自欺欺人。但是，也沒什麼不能理解的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家經歷過可怕的危險，同時還要面對未知的威脅。對一個外來者產生戒備，也是情有可原的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您，真的是這麼想的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說啦，如果我真的由著性子一走了之，不就真的變成預言裡，給夕照區帶來災難又消失不見的惡魔了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仇恨只能引起新的仇恨，永遠也不能換來諒解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想，是不是自己做點什麼，就可以改變一點大家的偏見，只要一點也好......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，我好像有些頭暈，說了些奇怪的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"施耐德","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您，您先休息休息吧。我就在旁邊，有什麼事的話，您隨意使喚我就行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......情況總算好一些了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也喝口水，休息一下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳——咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"水......好渴......給我水......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這有水，給您！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳——呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感覺怎麼樣？還有沒有哪裡不舒服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你，你是薩卡茲嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許，您可以當我是卡普里尼嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別騙我，薩卡茲和卡普里尼的角，一眼就能看出區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，果然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"月亮，好圓......在月圓之夜見到薩卡茲，我是不是，快要死了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這又是哪裡的傳說，我可從來沒有聽過啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，頭真疼，我怎麼也開始胡言亂語啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"多謝你的照顧啊......薩卡茲也好，卡普里尼也好——來唱首歌吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唱歌？您的病情剛穩定下來，現在最好靜養吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"周圍太安靜了......就算明天就要死了，今晚也該有點音樂才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我唱歌，你用笛子來伴奏吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，如果這樣可以讓您覺得好受一點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，其實我不太會吹長笛的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很簡單的，跟上我的旋律就行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我來起個調，一、二——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天空湛藍晴朗，微風輕聲歌唱♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的病人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"河水潺潺流淌，我的心充滿希望♪......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"狹長的小巷寂寥寧靜，周圍的居民主動空出了這片區域留給無處安置的病人。\n斷斷續續的笛聲與歌聲在月色裡蕩漾，彷彿是撫慰著這座剛經歷過動亂的城市的安眠曲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","aliases":["芙蓉"]}]}
